      "text": "Cassian glanced at the split skin on her knuckles.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=03f39481c6624fa7b48bc3540819270e.wav",
