      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Shut up.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=ca6c796bd3114808930c40f5146dd292.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 0.9014512471655329
    },
    {
      "run_id": 24,
      "actor": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "He laughed, despite trying not to. Then he cleaned her knee with water from a bottle, tearing a strip from an old cloth when they ran out of proper bandages. She hissed when the cold water touched the scrape.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=827e8479af9242dc83d26b9bbeed8169.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 11.119410430839002
    },
    {
      "run_id": 25,
      "actor": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "Hold still, menace.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=6dea0947a6b64a76bbb5356bbd0c8190.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.0053061224489794
    },
    {
      "run_id": 26,
      "actor": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "You're pulling my leg off.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=fd52787b622d43e0900f0e7070120f6c.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 1.8164172335600908
    },
    {
      "run_id": 27,
      "actor": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "Yes. That's the treatment. All doctors do it.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=c0130b658885446d8ed1e681afb8e113.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 3.2665759637188208
    },
    {
      "run_id": 28,
      "actor": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "When he was done, he crouched in front of her and held out his hands.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=b7e00328b0f843a9bb361e0a3400b020.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 4.141814058956916
    },
    {
      "run_id": 29,
      "actor": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "Okay. Here's the important part. If somebody bigger than you starts trouble, you don't have to stand there and prove you're fearless.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=8bedbe19483b47d481ca9d195c6e3aec.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 6.919954648526077
    },
    {
      "run_id": 30,
      "actor": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "I wasn't scared.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=5560e536809c40e9bcc2957f5ca7cd39.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 1.406077097505669
    },
    {
      "run_id": 31,
      "actor": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "Then you should've been. Fear can be useful.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=ccf847eaea0743b481bcfaa144360f2f.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 2.9459863945578233
    },
    {
      "run_id": 32,
      "actor": "narrator",
      "voice_id": "a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "She hated that answer. Cassian tilted his head.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/a3a4aa242aaf431ea8ec2c4b3bb332fa/id=d146cd4819874216bca369de9e4a81c2.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 3.5497052154195012
    },
    {
      "run_id": 33,
      "actor": "cassian",
      "voice_id": "f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2",
      "gain": 1,
      "text": "Look at me. Nin. Being brave isn't the same as being stupid.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/f91cc0b0eea44f8391f080d2de079ea2/id=1b7de7e433894490961706ba5fea0f8f.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 4.606213151927438
    },
    {
      "run_id": 34,
      "actor": "ninja",
      "voice_id": "8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "You're stupid.",
      "audio_url": "https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=00db0f691ffb4c5a96dee51fedd33199.wav",
      "duration_seconds": 1.1571428571428573
    },
